                    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Top Reasons to Study in Latvia for Indian Students</h2>

                    <p style="line-height:1.8;">
                        Latvia is becoming one of the top emerging destinations for international education in Europe. Here are the key reasons why Indian students prefer studying in Latvia.
                    </p>

                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <h4>1. Affordable Tuition Fees</h4>
                        <p>Compared to many European countries, Latvia offers quality education at lower tuition fees, making it budget-friendly for Indian students.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <h4>2. Globally Recognized Universities</h4>
                        <p>Latvian universities provide internationally accepted degrees with modern teaching methods and practical learning opportunities.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <h4>3. English-Taught Programs</h4>
                        <p>Most universities offer bachelor's and master's programs in English, helping international students study comfortably without language barriers.</p>
