                        <li><strong>University of Latvia</strong> – Known for Science, Economics, Medicine, and Social Studies.</li>
                        <li><strong>Turiba University</strong> – Leading private university for Business, Tourism, and Communication Studies.</li>
                        <li><strong>Transport and Telecommunication Institute</strong> – Popular for Aviation, Logistics, Data Science, and IT.</li>
                        <li><strong>Latvian University of Life Sciences and Technologies</strong> – Agriculture, Veterinary Science, and Environmental Studies.</li>
